Description: OpenSesame plugin for playing and recording audio with low latency
 This plugin for the OpenSesame experiment builder plays and
 records wave files with low, predictable latency, in the
 foreground or in the background. It uses PyAlsaAudio (Linux)
 or SoundDevice (PortAudio).
